# AgenticGit — derived state, never committed
#
# Contracts and the event ledger ARE committed: two machines must agree on a
# published interface, and the ledger is the shared record. Everything else in
# `.agentgit/` is a view derived from them, and deriving it costs nothing.
.agentgit/state/
.agentgit/worktrees/

# Generated at install time with absolute paths to this machine's node and
# plugin directory. Committing it would ship one machine's paths to another.
plugins/agentgit/hooks.json
plugins/agentgit/.mcp.json

node_modules/
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Local demo scratch space
playground/*
!playground/.gitkeep

# Python bytecode from the parity test suite
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# The research directory keeps two things out on purpose.
#
# Third-party publications under `原文PDF/` and `原文文本/` are for local
# verification only; the research README states they are not redistributed with
# the output, so they must not reach a commit by a later `git add -A`.
#
# The Flask partial clone is an external data source, not this repository's
# content, and it carries its own `.git` which a parent repository must not adopt.
research/**/原文PDF/
research/**/原文文本/
research/03_基准与标注/benchmark/real-history/flask/repo/